  "paper_id": "asplos-2024-avoiding-instruction-centric-microarchitectural-timing-c-ee2c13f1",
  "title": "Avoiding Instruction-Centric Microarchitectural Timing Channels Via Binary-Code Transformations",
  "abstract": "With the end of Moore's Law-based scaling, novel microarchitectural optimizations are being patented, researched, and implemented at an increasing rate. Previous research has examined recently published patents and papers and demonstrated ways these upcoming optimizations present new security risks via novel side channels. As these side channels are introduced by microarchitectural optimization, they are not generically solvable in source code.",
